 "response": {
  "text": "Bilkul. **₹3,000 ke andar** abhi mujhe ye options sabse sensible lag rahe hain:\n\n### [Decathlon Jogflow 190.1 Men]()\n*₹2,499*\n\n### [Decathlon Jogflow 100]()\n*₹1,599*\n\n### [Kalenji Run Active Men]()\n*₹1,299*\n\n### [Decathlon Jogflow 100.1 Women]()\n*₹1,599*\n\n### [Reebok Flow Advance Men]()\n*₹1,150*\n\n### 🏃 Meri picks\n\n**1. Decathlon Jogflow 190.1 — ₹2,499 ⭐ Best overall**  \nAgar aap **regular running (5–10 km)** karte hain, ye meri first choice hogi. Cushioned hai aur Decathlon ise up to 20 km/week running ke liye list karta hai. [www.decathlon.in](https://www.decathlon.in/c/24175?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n**2. Kalenji Jogflow 100 — ₹1,599 💰 Best value**  \nBeginner ho aur 2–5 km daily/alternate-day run karna hai, to kaafi achha budget option. [www.decathlon.in](https://www.decathlon.in/c/24175?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n**3. Kalenji Run Active — ₹1,299**  \nRunning + walking + gym ka mix ho to economical choice. [www.decathlon.in](https://www.decathlon.in/c/24175?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n**4. Reebok Flow Advance — ~₹1,150**  \nAgar sale mein genuine pair mil raha ho, to price ke hisaab se attractive option hai.\n\n**5. Women ke liye Jogflow 100.1 — ₹1,599**  \nBeginner running ke liye strong value option; current listing mein 4.7/5 rating aur 3,400+ reviews dikh rahe hain.\n\n### 🏆 Agar mujhe ek hi lena ho\n- **Regular running:** Jogflow 190.1\n- **Beginner / 2–5 km:** Jogflow 100\n- **Maximum ₹1,500:** Run Active\n- **Women:** Jogflow 100.1\n\n₹3,000 ke budget mein **sirf brand/logo dekhkar Nike/Adidas lena zaroori nahi**—current Adidas sale mein bhi kaafi running models ₹1,800–₹3,000 range mein hain, lekin exact model aur fit zyada important hai. [www.adidas.co.in](https://www.adidas.co.in/shoes_under_3000-running-trainers?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\nAgar aap **men/women, running distance (3/5/10 km), aur road ya treadmill** bata do, main aapke liye **₹3,000 ke andar 3 exact best pairs** shortlist kar dunga.",
